<in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplanatoryTextBlock contextRef="OneD">Notes:-t t t t t t t t t t t   n1. The above Unaudited results (Standalone and Consolidated) have been prepared in accordance with Indian Accounting Standards (‘IND AS) notified under section 133 of the companies Act 2013, read  together with relevant rules issued there under and other accounting principles generally accepted in India.  n t t t t t t t t t t t   n2. The above financial results (Standalone and Consolidated) were reviewed and recommended by the Audit Committee on 14.02.2020  and subsequently approved by the Board of Directors at its meeting held on 14.02.2020. The Statutory Auditors of the Company have carried out a Limited Review of the aforesaid results.   n t t t t t t t t t t t   n3. During the Quarter, Company received order from   Hon’ble Income Tax Settlement Commission (ITSC) finally settling the application for settlement pending before ITSC as per the Income Tax Act 1961. However, the order giving effect with respect to said order shall be provided in books of accounts in the Quarter in which the order giving effect from the Office of Assessing Officer is received.      n t t t t t t t t t t t   n4. The increase in other expense in current quarter in Consolidated Results include impact of cost for settlement of Patent Case in France of Rs. 503 Lakhs in the subsidiary NRF BV Netherland, net of Partial recovery from supplier.    n t t t t t t t t t t t   n5.The increase in Employee Benefit Expenses in current quarter in Consolidated Results include impact of incidental cost (One off) for pension premiums of Rs. 425 Lakhs in the subsidiary NRF BV Netherland following from court ruling.     n t t t t t t t t t t t   n6. The Company is primarily engaged in Automobile Ancillary business and therefore there is only one reportable segment.  n t t t t t t t t t t t   n7. The figures for the corresponding previous period have been regrouped/reclassified wherever necessary, to make them comparable with the figures of current period.   n t t t t t t t t t t t   n8. The above results of the Company are available on the Company's website www.bancoindia.com and also on www.bseindia.com and www.nseindia.com.t   n t t t t t t t t t t t   n t t t t t t t t t t t   n t t t t t For Banco Products (India) Limitedt t t t   n t t t t t t t t t t t   n t t t t t t t t t t t   nPlace -tBilt t t t (Rajendra J. Anandpara)t t t t   nDate :- t14.02.2020t t t t Managing Director</in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplanatoryTextBlock>
